$\begin{align}
x&=\dfrac{-\blueD{b} \pm \sqrt{\blueD{b}^2-4\greenD{a}\purpleC{c}}}{2\greenD{a}}
\\\\
x&=\dfrac{-(\blueD{-8}) \pm \sqrt{(\blueD{-8})^2-4(\greenD{1})(\purpleC{2})}}{2(\greenD{1})}
\\\\
x&=\dfrac{8 \pm \sqrt{64-8}}{2}
\\\\
x&=\dfrac{8 \pm \sqrt{56}}{2}
\\\\
x&=\dfrac{8 \pm \left( \sqrt{4} \cdot \sqrt{14} \right)}{2}
\\\\
x&=\dfrac{8 \pm 2 \sqrt{14}}{2}
\\\\
x&=4 \pm\sqrt{14}
\end{align}$
